# Optional Worker-only alternative to .env. Wrangler prefers .dev.vars over .env.
# Use one runtime secrets file to avoid accidentally running with an old secret.
# Extension builds read .env, so their token must match the Worker secret here.
# Master secret protecting library sign-in, extension ingestion, and MCP access.
ANANSI_SECRET=

# Optional role keys override the master secret for their respective endpoints.
# Set a distinct INGEST_TOKEN to keep the Chrome extension from accessing
# library sign-in or MCP with its key. Generate each key independently.
# LIBRARY_TOKEN=
# INGEST_TOKEN=
# MCP_TOKEN=

